{"n":45,"v":[["H'â, Mîm","",[[["حمٓ","P","INL|",-1]]]],["La révélation du Livre émane d'Allah, le Puissant, le Sage","",[[["تَنزِيلُ","N","VN|VF:2|M|NOM",622]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["كِتَٰبِ","N","M|GEN",46]],[["مِنَ","P","P",0]],[["ٱللَّهِ","N","PN|GEN",1]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["عَزِيزِ","N","MS|GEN|ADJ",104]],[["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["حَكِيمِ","N","MS|GEN|ADJ",106]]]],["Il y a certes dans les cieux et la terre des preuves pour les croyants","",[[["إِنَّ","P","ACC|FAM:إِنّ",4]],[["فِى","P","P",3]],[["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["سَّمَٰوَٰتِ","N","FP|GEN",34]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱلْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["أَرْضِ","N","F|GEN",21]],[["لَ","P","EMPH|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["ءَايَٰتٍ","N","FP|INDEF|GEN",26]],[["لِّ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["لْ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["مُؤْمِنِينَ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:4|MP|GEN",52]]]],["Et dans votre propre création, et dans ce qu'Il dissémine comme animaux, il y a des signes pour des gens qui croient avec certitude","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["فِى","P","P",3]],[["خَلْقِ","N","M|GEN",212],["كُمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|2MP",-1]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["مَا","N","REL",6]],[["يَبُثُّ","V","IMPF|VF:1|3MS|MOOD:IND",1257]],[["مِن","P","P",0]],[["دَآبَّةٍ","N","F|INDEF|GEN",521]],[["ءَايَٰتٌ","N","FP|INDEF|NOM",26]],[["لِّ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["قَوْمٍ","N","M|INDEF|GEN",24]],[["يُوقِنُ","V","IMPF|VF:4|3MP|MOOD:IND",686],["ونَ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]]]],["De même dans l'alternance de la nuit et du jour, et dans ce qu'Allah fait descendre du ciel comme subsistance [pluie] par laquelle Il redonne la vie à la terre une fois morte, et dans la distribution des vents, il y a des signes pour des gens qui raisonnent","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱخْتِلَٰفِ","N","VN|VF:8|M|GEN",1021]],[["ٱلَّ","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["يْلِ","N","M|GEN",123]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["ٱل","P","DET|PREF|LEM:ال",-1],["نَّهَارِ","N","M|GEN",197]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1