ns son orgueil, comme s'il ne les avait jamais entendus. Annonce-lui donc un châtiment douloureux","",[[["يَسْمَعُ","V","IMPF|VF:1|3MS|MOOD:IND",134]],[["ءَايَٰتِ","N","FP|GEN",26]],[["ٱللَّهِ","N","PN|GEN",1]],[["تُتْلَىٰ","V","IMPF|VF:1|PASS|3FS|MOOD:IND",185]],[["عَلَيْ","P","P",8],["هِ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MS",-1]],[["ثُمَّ","P","CONJ",31]],[["يُصِرُّ","V","IMPF|VF:4|3MS|MOOD:IND",1487]],[["مُسْتَكْبِرًا","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:10|M|INDEF|ACC",1222]],[["كَأَن","P","ACC|FAM:إِنّ",900]],[["لَّمْ","P","NEG",29]],[["يَسْمَعْ","V","IMPF|VF:1|3MS|MOOD:JUS",134],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]],[["فَ","P","REM|PREF|LEM:ف",-1],["بَشِّرْ","V","IMPV|VF:2|2MS",292],["هُ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MS",-1]],[["بِ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ب",-1],["عَذَابٍ","N","M|INDEF|GEN",33]],[["أَلِيمٍ","N","MS|INDEF|GEN|ADJ",151]]]],["S'il a connaissance de quelques-uns de Nos versets, il les tourne en dérision. Ceux-là auront un châtiment avilissant","",[[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["إِذَا","N","T",23]],[["عَلِمَ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MS",25]],[["مِنْ","P","P",0]],[["ءَايَٰتِ","N","FP|GEN",26],["نَا","N","PRON|SUFF|1P",-1]],[["شَيْـًٔا","N","M|INDEF|ACC",38]],[["ٱتَّخَذَ","V","PERF|VF:8|3MS",90],["هَا","N","PRON|SUFF|3FS",-1]],[["هُزُوًا","N","M|INDEF|ACC",744]],[["أُو۟لَٰٓئِ","N","DEM|P",10],["كَ","P","ADDR|SUFF|M",-1]],[["لَ","P","P|PREF|LEM:ل",-1],["هُمْ","N","PRON|3MP",-1]],[["عَذَابٌ","N","M|INDEF|NOM",33]],[["مُّهِينٌ","N","ACT_PCPL|VF:4|M|INDEF|NOM",631]]]],["l'Enfer est à leurs trousses. Ce qu'ils auront acquis ne leur servira à rien, ni ce qu'ils auront pris comme protecteurs, en dehors d'Allah. Ils auront un énorme châtiment","",[[["مِّن","P","P",0]],[["وَرَآئِ","N","GEN",421],["هِمْ","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["جَهَنَّمُ","N","PN|NOM",136]],[["وَ","P","CONJ|PREF|LEM:و",-1],["لَا","P","NEG",2]],[["يُغْنِى","V","IMPF|VF:4|3MS|MOOD:IND",378]],[["عَنْ","P","P",20],["هُم","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["مَّا","N","REL",6]],[["كَسَبُ","V","PERF|VF:1|3MP",183],["وا۟","N","PRON|SUFF|3MP",-1]],[["شَيْـًٔا","N","M|IN